# 📖 Functional Use Case Inventory — CodeMind Playbook

> **Purpose:** Instruct the CodeMind AI agent to analyze any repository and produce a
> comprehensive Functional Use Case Inventory Report — covering every externally-observable
> behavior, business rules, validation logic, test coverage, traceability, and gaps.
> Zero hardcoding. Every finding is derived exclusively from repository content.

---

## 📋 Playbook Metadata

```yaml
playbook_id:       functional-usecase-inventory
playbook_version:  1.0.0
target_tool:       CodeMind IDE
report_type:       Functional Use Case Inventory
applicable_to:     Any software repository (microservice, monolith, library,
                   batch job, data pipeline, UI app, CLI tool)
