| # | Area | Gap Category | Severity | Detail | Evidence |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| G-001 | [area name] | [category] | [CRITICAL/HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW] | [what's missing or wrong] | [file reference] |
```

